---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="RelayBridge website privacy" description="The RelayBridge website uses no analytics, advertising, tracking pixels, marketing cookies, or account system.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Website privacy" title="A small website" accent="with a small data footprint." description="This public website is intentionally static and does not include analytics, advertising, tracking pixels, marketing cookies, or user accounts." />
  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="container privacy-layout">
      <aside><span>LAST UPDATED</span><strong>23 August 2026</strong></aside>
      <div class="prose privacy-prose">
        <section><h2>What this website does not collect</h2><p>RelayBridge does not add analytics scripts, advertising technology, tracking pixels, marketing cookies, account registration, or contact forms to this website. There are no user profiles and no product telemetry collected through the public site.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Hosting infrastructure</h2><p>When the website is deployed, its hosting and network providers may process ordinary request metadata needed to serve and protect the site, such as an IP address, requested URL, timestamp, and browser information. That infrastructure processing is outside the application code in this repository.</p></section>
        <section><h2>External links</h2><p>This website links to external services such as GitHub and email clients. Those services operate under their own privacy terms. RelayBridge does not embed their widgets or tracking code.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this website can be sent to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@getrelaybridge.com">info@getrelaybridge.com</a>. Sending email shares the information you include with the receiving mail provider.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Changes</h2><p>This statement will be updated if the website later adds analytics, support systems, forms, or other data-processing features. The current site has none of those features.</p></section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
